// `--tv` is CLEAN on this file (probed 2026-08-25) - TradingView compiles
// every line. That is why the rule is a lint-stage warning and not an error.
//
//     pine-lint -H <this file>   -> 3 ARGUMENT_OUT_OF_RANGE warnings
//     pine-lint --tv -H <file>   -> clean
//
// Whether TV clamps or raises at runtime is unmeasured; a chart capture would
// be needed (G010), and the rule's message deliberately claims neither.
//@version=6
indicator("out of documented range")
over = color.rgb(300, 0, 0)
transp = color.new(color.red, 150)
under = color.rgb(-1, 0, 0)
plot(1, color = over)
plot(2, color = transp)
plot(3, color = under)
